msgid ""
"// SAFETY: BaseApi never changes once loaded, so it will be shared between "
"threads.\n"
"// (Manual implementations necessary due to `*mut c_void` not being `Send` "
"or `Sync`).\n"
"// \n"
"// (This is likely not necessary if using the typed struct approach, as the "
"compiler can see the real function pointers which are likely `Send` / "
"`Sync`).\n"
msgstr ""

